    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The invasion has begun. An alien race has descended upon your homeland, and it\u2019s up to you to protect it! In <i>Bumper Blitz TD</i>, relentless waves of extraterrestrial enemies challenge your wits and reflexes in a tower defense game like no other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Gameplay Mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a thrilling blend of strategy and action as you harness the power of pinball mechanics to fend off alien forces.</p> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Place towers to defend your nano core</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300140/extras/4f21ee594a337e6f89bda34049850f77.poster.avif?t=1754967072\" width=600 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300140/extras/4f21ee594a337e6f89bda34049850f77.webm?t=1754967072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300140/extras/4f21ee594a337e6f89bda34049850f77.mp4?t=1754967072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use pinball bumpers strategically to redirect enemies</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300140/extras/12b80a6deb618961db7b19a4cf3ef54e.poster.avif?t=1754967072\" width=600 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300140/extras/12b80a6deb618961db7b19a4cf3ef54e.webm?t=1754967072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300140/extras/12b80a6deb618961db7b19a4cf3ef54e.mp4?t=1754967072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gravity and physics mayhem meet tower defense</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300140/extras/54aedd7d561f8054b8fbfbd1743690f3.poster.avif?t=1754967072\" width=600 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300140/extras/54aedd7d561f8054b8fbfbd1743690f3.webm?t=1754967072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300140/extras/54aedd7d561f8054b8fbfbd1743690f3.mp4?t=1754967072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since gravity and physics are at the core of this game, it\u2019s never exactly the same game twice. <i>Bumper Blitz TD</i> offers a challenging experience for both newcomers and seasoned tower defense veterans.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take on the invaders and reclaim your world? The ultimate test of your strategy and skill awaits. Stand tall, your planet\u2019s fate is in your hands!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The invasion has begun. An alien race has descended upon your homeland, and it\u2019s up to you to protect it! In <i>Bumper Blitz TD</i>, relentless waves of extraterrestrial enemies challenge your wits and reflexes in a tower defense game like no other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Gameplay Mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a thrilling blend of strategy and action as you harness the power of pinball mechanics to fend off alien forces.</p> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Place towers to defend your nano core</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300140/extras/4f21ee594a337e6f89bda34049850f77.poster.avif?t=1754967072\" width=600 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300140/extras/4f21ee594a337e6f89bda34049850f77.webm?t=1754967072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300140/extras/4f21ee594a337e6f89bda34049850f77.mp4?t=1754967072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use pinball bumpers strategically to redirect enemies</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300140/extras/12b80a6deb618961db7b19a4cf3ef54e.poster.avif?t=1754967072\" width=600 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300140/extras/12b80a6deb618961db7b19a4cf3ef54e.webm?t=1754967072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300140/extras/12b80a6deb618961db7b19a4cf3ef54e.mp4?t=1754967072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gravity and physics mayhem meet tower defense</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300140/extras/54aedd7d561f8054b8fbfbd1743690f3.poster.avif?t=1754967072\" width=600 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300140/extras/54aedd7d561f8054b8fbfbd1743690f3.webm?t=1754967072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300140/extras/54aedd7d561f8054b8fbfbd1743690f3.mp4?t=1754967072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since gravity and physics are at the core of this game, it\u2019s never exactly the same game twice. <i>Bumper Blitz TD</i> offers a challenging experience for both newcomers and seasoned tower defense veterans.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take on the invaders and reclaim your world? The ultimate test of your strategy and skill awaits. Stand tall, your planet\u2019s fate is in your hands!</p>",
